<Class name="IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.CernAdtHl7ToTelcor">
<Description>
BPL for ADT Telcor. It subscribes to Sunquest translator (which is feed by Cerner Legacy) and converts it to Telcor specific.</Description>
<Super>IHC.ITF.ITFCOMMON.Process.ItfBusinessProcessBPL</Super>
<TimeCreated>63923,37821.796485</TimeCreated>

